This is 99% invisible. I'm Roman Mars. The moment is at hand the countdown reaches zero. In 1957, a few months after the Soviet satellite's Sputnik became the first human object in space, the United States launched Explorer I. Explorer is in orbit, broadcasting to the world its code and scientific data, cosmic ray intensity, meteor impact, solar radiation. These are the dry facts that will help carry a man ever father into the age of sleep. And with that, the space race was underway.
