almost like freeways. And the traffic on those freeways is actually quite a lot, and that's where the problem starts to emerge. As the traffic increases, so does the chance of collision. One of the regions of space that got busy pretty quickly is the area called Low Earth Orbit. That's a region of space that extends up to an altitude of about 2000 kilometers. That's really heavily congested.
几乎就像高速公路一样。这些高速公路上的交通量其实非常大，问题也正是从这里开始出现的。随着交通量的增加，碰撞的几率也在增加。太空里很快变得繁忙的区域之一是被称为低地球轨道的区域。那是延伸到大约2000公里高度的太空区域。那里真的非常拥挤。

